function shareMetadataRows(f,opts){const rows=[];if(opts.credits){for(const[label,value]of [['Director',f.director],['Writer',f.screenplay],['Cinematographer',f.cinematography],['Music',f.music],['Cast',f.cast.join(' · ')]])if(value)rows.push({label,value:String(value)})}if(opts.watched){const w=latest(f);if(w.date)rows.push({label:'Watched Date',value:dateText(w.date)})}return rows}
function shareMeasureRows(ctx,rows,width=SHARE_LAYOUT.metadataWidth){shareFont(ctx,SHARE_TYPE.metadata);return rows.map(row=>({...row,lines:shareLines(ctx,row.value,width-190)})).map(row=>({...row,height:Math.max(1,row.lines.length)*SHARE_TYPE.metadataLine+SHARE_TYPE.metadataGap}))}
